म्), acc. ind. (g. स्वर्-आदि, not in Kāś.) for a long time, TS. v f.; Mn.; MBh. &c.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "after a long time, slowly, RV. v, 56, 7 & 79, 9; AitBr. i, 16; Kathās. iv, 31", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "cireRa": [{"id": "cireRa", "headword": "चिरेण", "headword_slp1": "cireRa", "fold": "cireRa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "चिरेण (एण), instr. ind. after a long time, late, not immediately, slowly, MBh.; R.; Pāṇ. i, 1, 70, Vārtt. 4, Pat.; Ragh. v, 64", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "for a long time (see also कि॑यत्), MBh. xii, 9484", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "ever, at all times, Prab. ii, 23/24", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "ciraya": [{"id": "cirAya", "headword": "चिराय", "headword_slp1": "cirAya", "fold": "ciraya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "चिराय (आय), dat. ind. for a long time, MBh.; Śak.; Kum. v, 47; Ragh. xiv, 59 &c.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "after a long time, at last, finally, too late, MBh.; R.; Pañcat.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "चिराय Nom. P. Ā. (p. ˚यमाण) id., MBh. &c.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}, {"id": "ciraya", "headword": "चिरय", "headword_slp1": "ciraya", "fold": "ciraya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "चिरय Nom. ˚यति, to act slowly, delay, be absent a long while, Mṛcch. (once Ā.), Mālav. &c.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "cirat": [{"id": "cirAt", "headword": "चिरात्", "headword_slp1": "cirAt", "fold": "cirat", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "चिरा॑त् (आत्), abl. ind. after a long time, late, at last, ŚāṅkhŚr. xiv; R.; Pañcat.; Ragh.; Kathās.; Amar.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "for a long time (also ˚रात्-प्रभृति, Hariv. 9860; Mālav. iii, 19; iv, 13), BhP. v, 6, 3; Kathās.; Hit.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "cirasya": [{"id": "cirasya", "headword": "चिरस्य", "headword_slp1": "cirasya", "fold": "cirasya", "headw